# Market Gnome's "you" is its controller (CR 603.2, 109.5), not its owner or whoever's turn it is. Bot1 casts their Gnome on turn
# one. On turn four Bot2 takes it with Act of Treason and crafts Dire Flail with it as the material, an artifact creature
# they control until end of turn: the Gnome is exiled while Bot2 activates a craft ability, so Bot2 gains 1 life and draws
# a card, and Bot1, its owner, does neither.

