Mox Pearl
Market Gnome
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Dire Flail
Act of Treason
Mountain
Island x10

